# Title: Proxy Execution Via Wuauclt.EXE
# ID: af77cf95-c469-471c-b6a0-946c685c4798
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Roberto Rodriguez (Cyb3rWard0g), OTR (Open Threat Research), Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Sreeman, FPT.EagleEye Team
# Date: 2020-10-12
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218, attack.execution
# Description: Detects the use of the Windows Update Client binary (wuauclt.exe) for proxy execution.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((cmdline:*UpdateDeploymentProvider* AND cmdline:*RunHandlerComServer*)) AND ((process_name:*\\wuauclt.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"wuauclt.exe"))) AND -(((cmdline:* /UpdateDeploymentProvider UpdateDeploymentProvider.dll *) OR ((cmdline:*:\\Windows\\UUS\\Packages\\Preview\\amd64\\updatedeploy.dll /ClassId* OR cmdline:*:\\Windows\\UUS\\amd64\\UpdateDeploy.dll /ClassId*)) OR ((cmdline:*:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\* AND cmdline:*\\UpdateDeploy.dll /ClassId *)) OR (cmdline:* wuaueng.dll *))))
